  "title": "Suriname: TotalEnergies acquires 25% interest in Block 53",
  "summary": "Paris, June 27, 2025 – TotalEnergies has signed an agreement to acquire the 25% interest held by Moeve (formerly known as CEPSA) in Block 53, offshore Suriname, joining APA (45%, operator) and Petronas (30%) as partner in this license. Block 53 lies directly east of Block 58, where TotalEnergies (40%*, operator) and its partners announced […]",
